SUMMARY:Old School Discussion: Consciousness-Raising Revisited
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\n### Week 4 — **Bodies\, Desir
 e\, Safety\, and Sexuality**:\n\n*What messages did we receive about our b
 odies and our freedom?*\n\n**Quick correction: this Saturday\, June 20\, i
 s Week 4 of our CR series.**\nWe’ll explore the messages we received abo
 ut our bodies\, attractiveness\, consent\, fear\, aging\, visibility\, and
  personal freedom.\n\nNote: The final CR session will be Saturday\, June 2
 7: What Do We Build Now?\n\nThe group remains limited to 10 participants\,
  so please RSVP if you plan to attend. This is our last meeting of this se
 ries.\n\nImmediately following this event\, LFS members will be meeting up
  for dinner at Indian Curry Lounge. Use the link to sign up for the dinner
  - https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/314836958\n
 \nEach session includes:\n\n* 3-minute speaking rounds\n* equal participat
 ion\n* the option to pass\n* attentive listening without interruption or d
 ebate\n* guided discussion around a weekly theme (90 minutes)\n* informal 
 conversation and socializing afterward (30 minutes)\n\nFacilitated by Susa
 n Guggenheim\, LFS member.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 315256677/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260614T160445Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260614T160445Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
